  :was-predicted 21
  :verdict "REFUTED"
  :compression "63 entries in 4 nodes = 15.75 entries/node, against a ceiling of 16.
                Segmentation is not merely working on this chain, it is working at
                essentially its maximum ratio."
  :why-the-prediction-missed
  "The prediction was hops = (singles written before segmentation) + ceil(entries
   written after / 16), with :singles-at-2026-08-02 18 taken from ADR-2608021000
