   pre-segmentation single-entry nodes are ~86% of today's hop count and are never
   rewritten by design -- only a fold consumes them. Until one fold runs,
   segmentation cannot help this graph') is therefore VOID in both halves: a fold
   ran, and segmentation is helping."}

